  "scope": "Real Windows host. Native indexed callback and independent CPU readback over locked memory images. AMD profiling is a supervised diagnostic.",
  "mechanism": {
    "capture": "Three rolling successful synchronous CPU write durations and completion timestamps per aligned size, isolation unit and foreground compression policy. Coalesced controller handoff through the existing activity signal.",
    "window": "Native write and file-info service after callback serialization. Includes no retained user payload, no additional backing I/O, and no device query.",
    "admission": "Configured uniform package and in-process independent CPU decoder. Share aligned request geometry with measured deferred writes. Append, constrained, partial and failed writes do not advance the window.",
    "state": "Controller view receives ordinary demand. Matched automatic calibration and profitable mounted AMD admission remain open."
  },
